  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>SRH Haarlem University of Applied Sciences, established in 2021, offers you a truly international education in the Netherlands. You’ll find that the university emphasises application-oriented learning, small study groups, and active assessments. Whether you're looking to study business psychology, creative media, or digital transformation, SRH Haarlem offers you a supportive environment.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>AT SRH, you’ll join a community of students and professionals from all around the world. With small class sizes, you’ll get personalised tutoring during classes. The campus promotes a safe and lively environment, giving you modern facilities.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>SRH Haalem University of Applied Sciences offers you on-campus accommodations. These are usually studio houses, with all the basic facilities you need.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>At the campus, you’ll find the Cupola Cafe, which is the university’s central dining area. You can get a variety of food and beverages at this cafe. Additionally, there are several cafes, restaurants, and bars near the campus that you can explore.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
